  "body": "So is this no longer a problem?\n\nBy the way, I'm trying to find a standard reliable way of building ART locally, in order to test out the development version. \n\nI have found a relatively simple workflow which basically uses the cmake commands only. However, I still obtain a final package missing some libraries and crashing in certain circumstances. \n\nI had a look at the scripts and logs of the github builds and noticed that there are patches to be applied plus some other workaround, but I still couldn't reproduce a fully functional package.\n\nIs there a place where I can discuss this? Shall I open another issue?",
